  documented dark-gothic art direction. This makes every 1fps QA capture
  read as "flat/washed out/sconces don't glow" even though the underlying
  torches (`DungeonBuilder.AddTorches`, warm `(1.0,0.68,0.22)`,
  `LightEnergy=2.8`) are real, meaningful lights. **Any visual QA run against
  these test harnesses needs this caveat** — a "gameplay-lit" capture
